; Composition of two supplied mapping artifacts (A -> B and B -> C) into one
; (A -> C): node clusters by connected components, tensor routes by
; concatenating their conversion steps, and the common-value frontier by
; threading the first map's left-side recipes through the composed routes.
; Pure: it reads no graph and runs nothing. The result is a candidate that the
; planner (Inference_compare_plan.Structural) must still accept; composition
; never repairs a partition.

(library
 (name inference_compare_compose)
 (libraries err_trace fmt inference_compare_codecs inference_compare_schema))
